The `J` kernel `jKer` (J6SegSw3) of a padded `G`-row `v` is

  `jKer v = W ++ 0^{G-m}`, `W_r = dotF (cc_r) ((zext K z).drop r)`,
  `z = bwdK bs (fwdK fs (v.take m) []) [] []`

