`LJ s t λ w` has row sums `|C/2^P - I| ≤ η ≤ 1/4`, vanishes off the pattern
`bandS (λ+w) (s-λ-w)`, and `(|LJ|+1)²/2^P ≤ 1/8` (so also `η + |LJ|²/2^P ≤ 1/2`).
